    "mulaIast": "nanu- viśvasyādhyāsikatve prātibhāsikasthala iva viṣayendriyasannikarṣādhīnāyāḥ pratikarmavyavasthāyāḥ anupapattiriti cenna | vṛttiḥ pūrvameva ghaṭādīnāṃ caitanye'dhyāsena prātibhāsikasthalāpekṣayā vailakṣaṇyāt | tathā hi- antaḥkaraṇaṃ cakṣurvattejovayavi | taccendriyadvāreṇa tatsaṃyuktaṃ viṣayaṃ vyāpya tadākāraṃ bhavati | yathā nadyādyudakaṃ praṇālyā niḥsṛtya kedārādyākāraṃ bhavati | saiva vṛttirityucyate | tatra jīvacaitanyamavidyopādhikaṃ sat sarvagataṃ antaḥkaraṇopādhikaṃ sat paricchinnamiti matadvayam | tatrā'dye viṣayaprakāśakaṃ jīvacaitanyam | dvitīye brahmacaitanyam | ādye pakṣe'pi jīvacaitanyamavidyānāvṛtam, āvṛtaṃ ca | tatrā'dye vṛttirjīvacaitanyasya viṣayoparāgārthā | dvitīye tvāvaraṇābhibhavārthā | paricchinnatvapakṣe tu jīvacaitanyasya viṣayaprakāśakatadadhiṣṭhānacaitanyābhedābhivyaktyarthā | anāvṛtatvapakṣe hyanāvṛtaṃ sarvagatamapi jīvacaitanyaṃ tattadākāravṛttyaivoparajyate, na tu viṣayaiḥ, asaṅgatvāt, yathā gotvaṃ sarvagatamapi sāsnādimadvyaktyā'bhivyajyate, na tu kesarādimadvyaktyā | yathā vā pradīpaprabhā ākāśagandharasādivyāpinyapi tānaprakāśayantī rūpasaṃsargitayā rūpameva prakāśayati tadvat | kevalāgnyadāhyasyāpi ayaḥpiṇḍādisamārūḍhāgnidāhyatvavacca kevalacaitanyāprakāśyasyāpi ghaṭādestattadākāravṛttyupārūḍhacaitanyaprakāśyatvaṃ yuktam | evañcānāvṛtatvapakṣe tattadākāravṛttidvārā caitanyasya tattaduparāge tattadarthaprakāśaḥ | āvṛtatvapakṣe tattadākāravṛttyā tattadviṣayāvacchinnacaitanyāvaraṇābhibhavena tattadarthaprakāśaḥ | antaḥkaraṇāvacchinnacaitanyarūpatve jīvasyāvacchedakāntaḥkaraṇatattadviṣayākāravṛttyā tattadviṣayāvacchinnacaitanyābhivyaktau tattatprakāśaḥ |\n\nyadyapi prakāśakamadhiṣṭhanacaitanyaṃ sarvagataṃ jīvacaitanyaṃ cāntaḥkaraṇāvacchinnam, tathāpi caitanyābhedenābhivyaktatvād vyavasthopapattiḥ |\n\nnanu- iyaṃ pratikarmavyavasthā nopapadyate | tathā hi- svasannikṛṣṭendriyajanyasvajñānāt pūrvaṃ ghaṭādeḥ sattve pratītimātraśarīratvavyāptakālpanikatvāyogaḥ | na ca kālpanikatvaviśeṣaḥ prātibhāsikatvādireva tadvyāptaḥ, gauravāt | na ca pratītimātraśarīratvābhāve'pi jñānanivartyatvādinaiva kalpitatvaṃ bhaviṣyati | pratītimātraśarīratvābhāvena jñānavirtyatvābhāvasyāpyāpādyatvāt | pratīterviśvasatyatvena vā mithyātve'pi svapnādivadindriyasannikarṣanirapekṣatayaivopapatteḥ | vyāvahārikatvasyāpi bhrāntidairdhyamātreṇopapatteśceti cet, maivam | pratītimātraśarīratvasya kalpitatvaṃ na vyāpyam | dṛgdṛsyasambandhānupapattyādisahakṛtoktānumānāt prapañce kalpitatve siddhe pratyabhijñābalācca sthāyitve tatraiva vyabhicārāt | na ca śuktirūpyādipratyabhijñāsāmyaṃ prakṛtapratyabhijñāyā iti- vācyam, pratītyaviśeṣe'pi vaṇigvīthīsthaśuktirūpyayoḥ parīkṣitatvāparīkṣitatvābhyāṃ sthāyitvāsthāyitvarūpaviśeṣasambhavāt | tathāpi parokṣavṛtterivāparokṣavṛtterapi prakāśakatvamastu, kiṃ taduparaktacaitanyeneti cenna | parokṣasthale'pi parokṣavṛtyuparaktacaitanyasyaiva prakāśakatvāt | atha tatrāpyaparokṣaikarasacaitanyoparāge viṣayāparokṣyaprasaṅgaḥ, na | viṣayacaitanyābhivyaktāveva viṣayasyāparokṣyam | na ca parokṣasthale tadasti | viṣayendriyasannikarṣābhāvena viṣayaparyantaṃ vṛtteragamanād | antareva tatra dhīsamullāsāt | aparokṣasthale tu pramātṛcaitanyābhedābhivyaktādhiṣṭhānacaitanyoparāgo viṣaye'sti | tatra viṣayasya karmakārakatvāt | na ca vṛttigataviśeṣādāparokṣyam | tatra hi viśeṣo viṣayakṛtaścedomiti brūmaḥ | jātikṛtastu viśeṣo na sambhavati | so'yamiti pratyabhijñāyāṃ parokṣatvāparokṣatvayoḥ saṅkaraprasaṅgād, avyāpyavṛttitvāt, pramātvādināṃ saṅkaraprasaṅgācca |\n\nkiṃ ca vṛtterjaḍatvādeva na prakāśakatvam | na ca- vṛttāvantaḥkaraṇāvṛttyapi svaprakāśakatvaṃ jñānatvavaditi vācyam | svaprakāśātmasambandhenaiva tasyāḥ prakāśatvopapattau tatsvaprakāśatve mānābhāvāt | kiṃ ca ghaṭaṃ jānāmītyanubhūyamānasakarmakavṛttyanyā saṃvid ghaṭaprakāśarūpā ghaṭaḥ prakāśata ityākārakānubhavasiddhaiva | na ca karoti yatate calati gacchatītyādāvekārthatve'pi sakarmakākarmakatvasvabhāvatvadarśanād atrāpyekārthatve'pi tathā syāditi vācyam | tatrāpyekārthatvābhāvāt | anukūlayatno hi kṛñdhātvarthaḥ | yatyarthastu yatnamātram | evaṃ gamyartha uttarasaṃyogaphalakaḥ spandaḥ | calatyarthastu spandamātram | tathā caikārthakatve kutrāpi na sakarmakatvākarmakatvavyavasthā | na ca- tvanmate pariṇaterakarmakatvāt pariṇativiśeṣabhūtāyā vṛtteḥ kathaṃ sakarmakatvamiti vācyam | ekasya hi sakarmakatvākarmatve ekarūpeṇa viruddhe, na tu rūpāntareṇāpi, mānābhāvāt | yathā sthiterakarmikāyā api agamanatvena rūpeṇa sakarmakatvam, tathā pariṇatitvena rūpeṇākarmikāyā api vṛtteḥ jñānatvena sakarmakatvaṃ bhaviṣyatītyadoṣaḥ | nanu tarhyatītaḥ prakāśate iti dhīrna syāt, iṣṭāpatteḥ | tatrāpi vṛttipratibimbatacaitanyasattvena prakāśata ityādiprayogasambhavācca | nanu yathā ajñānavirodhivṛttāvanubhavatvaṃ nāsti, kiṃtu anyatra, tathā dveṣavirodhivṛtteranyatrecchātvamityapi syāditi cenna | bādhakasattvāsattvābhyāṃ viśeṣāt | atreva tatra sakarmakākarmakavilakṣaṇakriyānanubhavācca | yathā ca vṛttyatiriktabhānasiddhistathā svayaṃjyotiṣṭvaprastāve vistareṇa vakṣyāmaḥ |"
