    "mulaIast": "nanu- yadyapi salila eko draṣṭā advaita ityatra salilaśabdasya tatsādṛśyasvacchatvamātraparatvāt tasya ca sarvamalāsaṃsargitvasvarūpasyādvaite'pyupapatteḥ, `sadeva somyedamagra āsī'dityatra cāgrapadasya `tadaikṣata nāmarūpe vyākaro'dityādeśca kālekṣaṇanāmarūpātmakaprapañcaprāpakasyāvidyakadvaitaviṣayakatvena vāstavādvaitavirodhitvābhāvaḥ tathāpi `sadeva sobhyedamagra āsī'dityanena idaṃ śabdoditasya viśvasya sadabhedena sattvamuktvā punaradvitīyapadena tanniṣedhe vyāghātaḥ | na hi `sadāsī'dityasyāsadāsīdityartha iti cenna, sadvyatirekeṇa nāsīdityarthasyaiva niṣedhārthatvāt | vivṛtaṃ caitad bhāṣyakārādibhirārambhaṇādhikaraṇe | na ca- sadvyatirekeṇāsattvoktau sadātmanā satyatvamāgacchatīti vācyam | āgacchatu nāma | ko hi brahmābhinnasyāsattvasādhanāya pravṛttau yo bibhīyāt | advaitavākyasya ca ṣaḍvidhatātparyaliṅgavattayā balavattvenāvidyakadvaitapratipādakatvaṃ sṛṣṭyādivākyānāmiti śravaṇasvarūpanirūpaṇe vedāntakalpalatikāyāmabhihitamasmābhiḥ, ihāpyabhidhāsyate ṣaḍvidhatātparyaliṅgāni pradarśayadbhiḥ | ata ekavijñānena sarvavijñānapratijñayopakramāt `etadātmyamidaṃ sarvaṃ tatsatyaṃ sa ātmā tattvamasī'tyupasaṃhārācca advaitasyaiva mahāprākaraṇikatayā tadanusāreṇa tadvākyasthapadānāṃ vyākhyeyatvāvadhāraṇāt, nānārthapadānāmarthāntaropasthāpakatvasambhave'pi prakṛtavākyārthānanvayitayā tatparityāgena prakṛtavākyārthānukūlapadārthopasthitiparatvamevāstheyam | tatra na dvitīyamadvitīyamiti tatpuruṣābhyupagame na dvitīyam kiṃtu prathamaṃ tṛtīyaṃ vetyarthaḥ syāt, sa ca na sambhavati tayorapi kiñcidapekṣya dvitīyatvād | ato na vidyate dvitīyaṃ yatreti bahuvrīhirevādaraṇīyaḥ | na ca ekenaivādvitīyapadena bhedatrayaniṣedhasambhave ekāvadhāraṇapadayorvaiyarthyamiti vācyam | vijātīyaṃ kiñcidapekṣya dvitīyatvāvacchinnaniṣedhasyādvitīyaśabdārthatvāt | ayaṃ cātra saṅkoco balīvardapadasannidhānād gopada iva sajātīyasvagatabhedaniṣedhakaikāvadhāraṇapadasannidhiprayukta eva | taduktam-\n\nvṛkṣasya svagato bhedaḥ patrapuṣpapalādibhiḥ |\nvṛkṣāntarātsajātīyo vijātīyaḥ śilāditaḥ ||\ntathā sadvastuno bhedatrayaṃ prāptaṃ nivāryate |\nekāvadhāraṇadvaitapratiṣedhaistribhiḥ kramāt || iti |\n\nsvagatabhedaḥ nānātvarūpajīveśvarabhedaḥ | sajātīyabhedo'tra dravyatvādinā sajātīyapṛthivyādibhedaḥ | vijātīyabhedo guṇādibhedaḥ | athavā jaḍabhedo vijātīyabhedaḥ | caitanyabhedaḥ sajātīyabhedaḥ | jñānānandādidharmabhedaḥ svagatabhedaḥ | yadi ca \"asya gordvitīyo'nveṣṭavya ityukte gaureva dvitīyo'nviṣyate, nāśvo na gardabha\" iti mahābhāṣyānusārāt samānajātīyadvitīyaparatvaṃ dvitīyaśabdasya tadā advitīyaśabdasya sajātīyabhedaniṣedhaparatvam, vijātīyasvagatabhedaniṣedhaparatvaṃ tu ekāvadhāraṇapadayoryatheṣṭaṃ vyākhyeyam | athavā advitīyapadenaiva bhedatrayaniṣedhaḥ, ekāvadhāraṇapade tu saṅkocaśaṅkāparihārāya |\n\nyattu kenacit pralapitaṃ- dvitīyaśabdaḥ sahāyavācī, `asidvitīyo'nusasārapāṇḍava'miti prayogāt, `asidvitīyaḥ asisahāyaḥ' iti mahāmāṣyokteśca, tathā cādvitīyamasahāyamityartho'stu, evamekaśabdasyāpi nānārthatvenāviruddhārthamādāyopapattau na mithyātvaparyavasāyitā''stheyā | tathā ca `eke mukhyānyakevalā' ityamaraḥ, `ekaśabdo'yamanyapradhānāsahāyasaṅkhayāprathamasamānavācī'ti `eko gotra' iti sūtre kaiyaṭaḥ | `ṣṇāntāṣaḍi'ti sūtre mahābhāṣyakāro'pi ekaśabdo'yaṃ bahvarthaḥ, asti saṅkhayārthaḥ, astyasahāyavācī, astyanyārthaḥ ityādi vyākhyātavān | tathā ca jīvādibhyo'nyatvaṃ prādhānyaṃ vā ekaśabdārtho'stu | evamanyānyapi śrutipadāni vyākhyeyāni iti | tat pūrvoktayuktibhirapāstam | vistareṇa ca vakṣyate tātparyanirūpaṇe | tadevaṃ sadrūpe brahmaṇi padatrayeṇa bhedatrayaniṣedhāt tadbhinnamithyātve paryavasitaṃ `ekamevādvitīya'ti vākyam | evamanyā api śrutayaḥ smṛtayaśca granthavistarabhayānnodāhṛtāḥ | svayameva sūribhirākāre draṣṭavyāḥ ||\n\nityadvaitasiddhau sarvādvaitaśruteḥ advaitatātparyakatvanirṇayaḥ |"
